WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.550
Ryu blocks Drive Impact near the wall.

2
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.000
The blocked Impact produces a normal wall splat.

3
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.450
Standing medium punch picks up the farther splat.

4
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:03.550
Heavy Power Wave extends the corner juggle.

5
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:05.750
Heavy Rising Tackle completes the wall-splat conversion.
